      "message": "Cherry pick is not clean. These are the differences between the original change and this cherry-pick:\nChecked against UPSTREAM commit: [googlesource](https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/d1abd69534bec16c43c633313e8e937af1354a7a) [kernel.org](https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id\u003dd1abd69534bec16c43c633313e8e937af1354a7a)\n\n```\n      ## drivers/phy/qualcomm/Kconfig ##\n     @@ drivers/phy/qualcomm/Kconfig: config PHY_QCOM_PCIE2\n    @@ drivers/phy/qualcomm/Kconfig: config PHY_QCOM_PCIE2\n     +config PHY_QCOM_QMP_COMBO\n     +\ttristate \"Qualcomm QMP Combo PHY Driver\"\n     +\tdefault PHY_QCOM_QMP\n    - \tselect GENERIC_PHY\n    - \tselect MFD_SYSCON\n    - \thelp\n    --\t  Enable this to support the QMP PHY transceiver that is used\n    --\t  with controllers such as PCIe, UFS, and USB on Qualcomm chips.\n    ++\tselect GENERIC_PHY\n    ++\thelp\n     +\t  Enable this to support the QMP Combo PHY transceiver that is used\n     +\t  with USB3 and DisplayPort controllers on Qualcomm chips.\n     +\n    @@ drivers/phy/qualcomm/Kconfig: config PHY_QCOM_PCIE2\n     +config PHY_QCOM_QMP_PCIE_8996\n     +\ttristate \"Qualcomm QMP PCIe 8996 PHY Driver\"\n     +\tdepends on PCI || COMPILE_TEST\n    -+\tselect GENERIC_PHY\n    + \tselect GENERIC_PHY\n     +\tdefault PHY_QCOM_QMP\n    -+\thelp\n    + \thelp\n    +-\t  Enable this to support the QMP PHY transceiver that is used\n    +-\t  with controllers such as PCIe, UFS, and USB on Qualcomm chips.\n     +\t  Enable this to support the QMP PCIe PHY transceiver that is used\n     +\t  with PCIe controllers on Qualcomm msm8996 chips.\n     +\n```\n\nPlease refer to the contribution guidelines for details:\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android-mainline/README.md\nAyeAye - CL 595687226 android-build.ayeaye-python-dispatcher_20240104.04_p0",
